#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:9
#: 30cc2d4ce7404cbb98cf34d50114649a 34d07d1ea43146cea87468c773af5a1b
#: 538d1ee7ffb54f1dafde80f8a62e6efe 5b3bcffbb9a3450db233f343d77218d6
#: 674048b015424af69ea9cc4cbf066a2c 9329c6b18fae48f48808a323bcb34d80
#: f40e69b1ec3643868dc8f111f5a5c798
msgid ""
"These instructions will show you how to download the latest firmware onto "
"the autopilot hardware that already has ArduPilot firmware installed. This "
"process will use the Mission Planner ground control station. See "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"这些说明将向您展示如何将最新固件下载到已安装 ArduPilot 固件的飞控硬件上。此过程将使用 Mission Planner 地面站。参见 "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。"

