"for some autopilots, it may be possible to update the firmware by "
":ref:`flashing from SD card <common-install-sdcard>`"
msgstr "对于某些飞控，可以通过 :ref:`从 SD 卡烧录 <common-install-sdcard>` 来更新固件"

