#: 6a99dda6158f47c3b7ff006fb2ee9723 824f0979d7ed47e8a4b9b859ce4d516f
#: f8afa389898e49ad800cc780f2e2a48d
msgid ""
"Windows should automatically detect and install the correct driver software."
msgstr "Windows 应自动检测并安装正确的驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:32
#: 2621815bb2bd44779d2a32b07654e743 406e446642654ab9a5518e2b751c93c4
#: 52b25e64228840219f0526644ea0eecb 7b5bb8a88dd14a0886be8964ec3fa0fc
#: a174bea5c89a49c1b558d8fe6ce2d720 c4e22dd717ea4f08bf82c7d0fdee68b7
#: fff4642cd2bf4bbd98e5f3de62d42463
msgid "Select the COM port"
msgstr "选择 COM 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:34
#: 546220d658ae4ed29ac884d11cd7148a 7ec770b44102413b896c7eef3c164551
#: 9f67f2525c4f4730b0c00d0a889b8ae4 b3ebd97e4e784a2eb8f598e5a73cae24
#: cd608fd085c94394a256fb202ba508fe d33900450d204a248bc88354bbdb93f5
#: dbaa0b5d9561467285eb40eca02e6640
msgid ""
"If using *Mission Planner* as the GCS, select the COM port drop-down in the "
"upper-right corner of the window near the **Connect** button. Select "
"**AUTO** or the specific port for your board. Set the Baud rate to "
"**115200** as shown. Do not hit **Connect** just yet."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 *Mission Planner* 作为 GCS，在窗口右上角 **Connect** 按钮旁边的 COM 端口下拉菜单中选择端口。选择 "
"**AUTO** 或飞控板的特定端口。将波特率设置为 **115200**，如图所示。暂时不要按 **Connect**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:40
#: 0ad347de1cf6414d9497e1d0f47d3ba1 3335849e1b854243951b499b1224b7d5
#: 5d9fcd606e3c41d38c88c55621f65fc6 6fb59c11fb244f068692278b1abd2fec
#: 73eaf8c3471b4f4c831ff7b5d73f3217 7ac72b43ba49477c88b70f55b259c5f9
#: ce30dc67e3fd46c28fec613720405153
msgid "Install firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:42
#: 23a3a03e97b54329a5b48c3b83ea3410 35060f689a9542549280fed23b67852e
#: 4a0fc282b42e49a08af397a8822c365d 847bfd2f365c40f88f01819e438c0167
#: 98cc31f657ee4a719f63bc2eca656e82 d0bea687212942928c589b6c8a4ec98f
#: d9c6a79b667e47bfa5a95bfb5a51cd75
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's **SETUP \\| Install Firmware** screen select the "
"appropriate icon that matches your vehicle or frame type(i.e. Quad, Hexa). "
"Answer **Yes** when it asks you \"Are you sure?\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的 **设置 \\| 安装固件** 界面中，选择与您飞行器或机架类型匹配的图标（如四旋翼、六旋翼）。当询问 "
"「确定吗？」 时，回答 **是**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:49
#: 12ea195a12a141989ef61de68df70d40 439faac0a5834e09a83b9b2cb40fba3c
#: 7a59b8c0c125408fae30bd3f3b6e20d4 8df6dcb3585940a3a78f003081373bb4
#: a4d4dd7f2e2e4f169900fdc6cf07eec5 c097dbff84d9484fba965658bfc03575
#: da5c8487a8d7417eb03aa3472fd81040
msgid "Mission Planner: Install FirmwareScreen"
msgstr "Mission Planner：安装固件界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:51
#: 00e1909c0ebb40f29d0c7ce1edb2cc7c 41d75609d39f4e1aa0b908b8054d65ef
#: 54352dd9f9c0434cbae6b3bc1d5159a1 66f64c4bf32c469eb890aacca02c3dd5
#: c2b369c51afa4300826e20d5947b96b7 eb7854114a304a7fb0f6dc4506bb1a02
#: ffe7e8ed2d134d589cebbe10d1fe63d2
msgid ""
"some boards are specifically targeted to a particular vehicle type and "
"firmware is not automatically built for other vehicles. However, ArduPilot "
"could still be built for those other vehicles using the `Custom Firmware "
"Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"某些飞控板专门针对特定飞行器类型，不会自动为其他飞行器构建固件。但是，ArduPilot 仍然可以使用 `自定义固件服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 为这些其他飞行器构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:53
#: 38ac719e5c574e6e93ca9b668c9f48e2 3f8635fb39524f37b56a8ccb3236998f
#: 865dc0603d874df3b7004e70c85f3b2f a43f7f0e2639434a8673acbf0f8752cb
#: a7eb03764d8c4b7bbda10b7f236b9fd6 d1e5adea130f4e8c83a6c4d749544587
#: df9fa3aa96f44a90abb67757c762c792
msgid ""
"Mission Planner will try to detect which board you are using. It may ask you"
" to unplug the board, press OK, and plug it back in to detect the board "
"type."
msgstr "Mission Planner 将尝试检测您使用的飞控板。它可能会要求您拔出飞控板，按 OK，再插回以检测飞控板类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:58
#: 0384017a49dd4483b632908021ca404c 2fe4cf81bf09455b926ecb6799712a22
#: 7b456fe6763a4b0cb74fd1a8309cef01 81530346c38b4b4588ce7cc06619a683
#: 82e7fad9f7fe4236a414fb666424208e c47623328e1147588fcda59c6a8f895a
#: cbf5692442e840c49c342fa244301778
msgid "Mission Planner: Install Firmware Prompt"
msgstr "Mission Planner：安装固件提示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:60
#: 04b4a493120e4216b4561d9c7c22f7a4 2d70dae850944af2b29130b14ee1983b
#: 32e6287a567c43248c074b83a09e3961 35fe2700c0624592bb1e43cc5e972a08
#: 770c9c4aef6a4d1ba0af6aeb302b7827 963f95a10cac495aaba9e15943c635ca
#: cc3d41311e55440eb1727d183adc95ec
msgid ""
"Often you will be presented with a dropdown box of firmware variants for the"
" board, which you can select from (such as bi-directional DShot variants, if"
" available). For boards which share the Pixhawk board id, the list will be "
"extensive, as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"通常会出现该飞控板固件变体的下拉框供您选择（如双向 DShot 变体，如果可用）。对于共享 Pixhawk 飞控板 ID "
"的飞控板，列表会很长，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:65
#: 049f51bd9c1949d7b0667d4270fdad09 1b3b42b73ffd47588eab54786942f7ef
#: 2e9a87e743db4407bf0db36e25b87a34 2ed0ad1a09c1490da0d9a7df3e6f09c4
#: 90162da1087d44a481d4334c942f15e2 93ab1aaf76fa4498b627368971f505bc
#: fa256b4586754063897b35541c37a3c2
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate firmware for your board. For boards marked "
"\"Pixhawk\", Pixhawk1 firmware is usually the best choice."
msgstr "为您的飞控板选择合适的固件。对于标记为 「Pixhawk」 的飞控板，Pixhawk1 固件通常是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:67
#: 0ac09822d9674bb98bdf08b8bf14b6e8 89b35ceea4584cac9ca34fc7d54200d6
#: b8061ec736114dd6868623ec4b7b4ae8 d392484cb7b941c4864246a73b894750
#: eafb368792a94e3990598d7d26bea7a5 eee4153a4093433398234227781dded6
#: f7a4772b676148408d319ab17c8ea961
msgid ""
"some boards labeled as Pixhawk 2.4.x may have sensor substitutions which may"
" lead to pre-arm checks or no secondary IMU. Please see the BARO_OPTIONS "
"parameter for a workaround for a known sensor substitution on some boards of"
" a MS5607 barometer where a MS5611 should be used. IMUs may also be "
"substituted. Where possible, please source autopilots from ArduPilot "
"partners."
msgstr ""
"部分标记为 Pixhawk 2.4.x 的飞控板可能存在传感器替换，可能导致解锁前检查失败或没有辅助 IMU。对于某些已知的 MS5607 "
"气压计（应使用 MS5611）传感器替换问题，请参阅 BARO_OPTIONS 参数的解决方法。IMU 也可能被替换。请尽量从 ArduPilot "
"合作伙伴处购买飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:69
#: 3ec4e0d2fa2e495b92f0e0db5013aedc 808a502acf8c45bdb3af1905943f1011
#: 8ab9d2480c3c433fbcddbc074919acfe ac926cdfd77640e7a869f24a312717c8
#: c3a388691ef14b4cbd47c07bd668fcb9 d43dce88d00345b98ad4c9912ba9cd6d
#: d74d4701579f4b25b627334b9f5590da
msgid ""
"If all goes well, you will see a status appear on the bottom right including"
" the words: \"erase...\", \"program...\", \"verify..\", and \"Upload Done\"."
" The firmware has been successfully uploaded to the board."
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，屏幕右下角会显示状态，包括：「erase...」、「program...」、「verify..」 和 「Upload "
"Done」。固件已成功上传到飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:71
#: 0d15212f1150442fbf1954bd91a017bd 220c1cee1bc34d868156b87d4e0f6864
#: 645e19f76aca45689ae5fbde635653b1 c4c4cfe3db0c490b8155a1b9aed6e6d1
#: c57619a13540463297bc6b4821705fb0 e5d89436f56043938adb62bc2133c9d8
#: e691b26100e44ae3909c34cf55e5b9b8
msgid ""
"It usually takes a few seconds for the bootloader to exit and enter the main"
" code after programming or a power-up. Wait to press CONNECT until this "
"occurs."
msgstr "烧录或上电后，引导程序通常需要几秒钟才能退出并进入主代码。请等到此过程完成后再按 CONNECT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:73
#: 0f44b6d23336473a87fc5c7675b75410 25a1a302a77042688dc91c14924c94a1
#: 3cb98584b34341f9896edfd45fcc3566 bc2dd0975a4143e5ad500123b0ba061b
#: c0ccada145814716bd88bcf42a2c67be dca3ada244bc493abd16fdb749b3a423
#: eda2eda69cfa496897a6fdb71e665724
msgid ""
"Updating the firmware to a newer version does not alter existing parameters "
"unless the firmware is for a different vehicle, in which case parameters are"
" reset to their default values for that vehicle. However, it is always a "
"good idea to save your parameters to a file using the \"Save to File\" "
"button on the Mission Planner's **CONFIG/Full Parameter Tree** tab before "
"any firmware updates, just in case of any issues while updating. Do not "
"apply all parameters after upgrading to a new version as some parameters "
"might have a different meaning."
msgstr ""
"将固件更新到新版本不会改变现有参数，除非固件适用于不同飞行器，在这种情况下参数将重置为该飞行器的默认值。但是，在任何固件更新前，始终建议使用 "
"Mission Planner **配置/完整参数树** 标签页上的 「保存到文件」 "
"按钮将参数保存到文件，以防更新时出现问题。升级到新版本后，请勿应用所有参数，因为某些参数可能含义不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:76
#: 17bcc2394af4455c8da62aa45496fc4d 384510680bf149f09a161da4abe7591f
#: 840798ec96aa4ce784829b78122402a0 92d185d5f5bd434a8d06974dbc2d7dba
#: 952d09258bad4c4b8fcf1ac9ac2d744e a551ef5f62234403ac999e821b5d1526
#: c85931a83a3a4e4aa22c8474f3798bc9
msgid "Using Beta, Developer, and Customized Versions"
msgstr "使用 Beta 版、开发者版和自定义版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:79
#: 006d5cb933514d2d98264e39cf666896 33112c310b6f4970b4279623611c9ad6
#: 659e3420b0fc41bcab3f59781dd6f911 6e1b83d014f54ac1bc9647b345ef5c4b
#: 7b5e5f9b2e8840e78d60f64f23fdc51a a9d0e954c92144819c74c78de81d8e5f
#: ad6a1da3a5b94a72a15987957edc6f8f
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:81
#: 175d30e0d2074ddf9131973f1aa4d724 537cfc6163f14f898cee627ce96612b5
#: 5999a20b1f0c41898756972a7eee6d3f 8af589051b5445c3b211a3397f662a99
#: a794826bce7440bcb1cfb7079bd8f6eb d5a9cf412612463492a6a19af08ef37d
#: f2dbfc48ec7c47a684d0b87d120e780a
msgid ""
"Prior to ``Stable`` releases, ``Beta`` versions are released. These may be "
"used if you wish to try newer features or help the developers flight test "
"new code. Since these are \"beta\" versions, there may still be bugs. This "
"is possible even in Stable release firmware. However, a Beta release has "
"been tested by the development team, and already flight tested. This release"
" allows a wider user base to final test the firmware before releasing as "
"``Stable``. Experienced ArduPilot users are encouraged to test fly this "
"firmware and provide feedback."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Stable`` 发布之前，会先发布 ``Beta`` "
"版本。如果您希望尝试新功能或帮助开发者飞行测试新代码，可以使用这些版本。由于是「测试版」，可能仍有缺陷。即使在 Stable 固件中也可能如此。但 "
"Beta 版本已经过开发团队测试并已飞行验证。此版本允许更广泛的用户群体对固件进行最终测试后再发布为 ``Stable``。鼓励有经验的 "
"ArduPilot 用户试飞该固件并提供反馈。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:83
#: 24c766a2334445a5af08e6ea9cfd813c 31960627170e4410a2fb56b0c091ea76
#: 41de681e8fbe41a798055551bc5dd79e 722a3eb4a9a442e6840d5ff651d424ad
#: 7c3d0ff11da84cc5937a30a5700f8f30 a92de050de2548bda9fecceeaeeb6f7c
#: fc8b5d3735dc450ca5a026cb4790bb7c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has an option on the **Install Firmware** page to upload "
"this release, but later ``Stable`` releases may already be available. Be "
"sure to check the normal vehicle upload option first."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 在 **安装固件** 页面上有上传此版本的选项，但可能已有更新的 ``Stable`` "
"版本可用。请务必先检查正常的飞行器上传选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:86
#: 0833c5049f0a4cd58343aa2894f9252a 46dc76891a754308ba1cf7154dc46e62
#: 60b1714003ea4f5d8927dc60c3f8ea86 8922a81f48324a229b15e5623a7bc424
#: 96687dc5adaa4ac6a54816a59e3d57ff 9c2cd2349a704fbf97d70b392b3d94ce
#: f4ad6a45213b4c279a655c16a59a4ad4
msgid "Latest Developer Version"
msgstr "最新开发者版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:88
#: 29048d667e4b4968953e71663526a288 2a343851091d46ccb6cdcaa6cc94d07b
#: 3805259920564365a1b4b83fb9be210c 43ec77c67c2a4cecbff28169ce6ba035
#: 9c7a6f5efe664746830e730baf11ef8a b57226cf3e0645d58bf0c76b2296c364
#: ec81c6c598954b87b8a2b0c781d02203
msgid ""
"This reflects the current state of the development branch of the ArduPilot "
"code. It has been reviewed by the development team, passed all automated "
"test suites, and in most cases test flown. This code gets built daily and is"
" available for testing by experienced users. This corresponds to an "
"\"alpha\" release, and may have bugs, although very rarely \"crash "
"inducing\". Very shortly after an addition that changes or introduces a "
"feature is added, the :ref:`Upcoming Features <common-master-features>` "
"section of the Wiki is updated with information about the addition or "
"change."
msgstr ""
"这反映了 ArduPilot "
"代码开发分支的当前状态。已经过开发团队审查，通过了所有自动化测试套件，并且在大多数情况下已进行飞行测试。该代码每日构建，供有经验的用户测试。这相当于 "
"「alpha」 发布，可能存在缺陷，但很少会 「导致坠机」。在添加新功能或更改功能后不久，Wiki 的 :ref:`即将推出的功能 <common-"
"master-features>` 部分会更新相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:90
